Z||000011||Monkeyman||06-02-2000||10:17 AM||||Scott (and whomever else is interested)--May I suggest that if you really want the "engraved" <B>PONTIAC</B> in your rear fascia, you cut one out of another rear fascia instead of a headlight door?  The one of the rear is a whole lot bigger than the one on the headlight door.  If you're a good body man (or know of one), you could cut out the area where the new <B>PONTIAC</B> will go and bond in the new one.  More work, time, and money, but a <B>MUCH</B> cleaner look.  Otherwise you'll just have another emblem.||||reg||1
